    },
    {
      "beat_id": "scene_002_b006",
      "paragraph_idx": 0,
      "source_sentence": "The baron won't allow a fork-tail to be killed because it's the last draconid for a thousand miles and no longer gives rise to fear but rather to compassion and nostalgia for times passed.",
